          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yahova Wuvunyali avoora ku vandu veve: “Munyi mwagulizwa vugira mitungu josi, kandi mulava avavoholore vugira kutunga esendi kali ndala. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Lwa mwazia komenya mu kivala cha Egebeti, kuli avageni, mwakora ndio ku liyaanza lienyu aveene. Lwa inyima, Asiria yamugumira nukumuvugula kuzinguru vugira kutunga kindu nukumudambiza. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na kalunu, kindu kilala chere kimali kwekoleka mu Babiloni. Muveeye avahambe, vugira kindu kutungwa kigira munyi. Yavo avamiiha ku munyi viyizominya niveevoola kandi vamanyiaa lilegeriza ku inzi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ISA 52:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku ing'inga yiza, munyi mulamanya ndi inzi mbeeye Nyasaye kandi mali komoloma.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ISA.52.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ISA.52.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Mutumikiri wa Yahova usaliraa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
